      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Oyg5NcPJvOwi8kVxyqvwa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20.53333536783856,
      "y": 2030.8776838514532,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 360116721,
      "version": 445,
      "versionNonce": 1236424753,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "问题：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "问题：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uCpuULuSkAeeRcSfSFsPf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 18.72333780924481,
      "y": 2065.8777754041876,
      "width": 202.01998901367188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1461592479,
      "version": 447,
      "versionNonce": 653928977,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. 整个过程是谁做的？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. 整个过程是谁做的？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HkIBQutySm2ZWygvvBg28",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40.353373209635436,
      "y": 2101.9779035780157,
      "width": 795.5599365234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1250266065,
      "version": 544,
      "versionNonce": 321699825,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "操作系统OS，那是谁让OS做的呢，操作系统必然会提供系统调用! 我们程序员所写的就可\n以调用系统调用，所以是用户让操作系统做的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "操作系统OS，那是谁让OS做的呢，操作系统必然会提供系统调用! 我们程序员所写的就可以调用系统调用，所以是用户让操作系统做的",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "w0gQlc8TK2KJDYyeRe1ES",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17.59333292643231,
      "y": 2167.2777082655157,
      "width": 367.47998046875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 860263871,
      "version": 373,
      "versionNonce": 1817287121,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. 共享区这个东西用户可以直接访问嘛？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 共享区这个东西用户可以直接访问嘛？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1SsimqUpNqwaU66XJdwLj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47.73334757486987,
      "y": 2199.6777937147344,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2053499313,
      "version": 386,
      "versionNonce": 1669347249,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "共享区这个不属于内核空间，是属于用户空间的。所以我们用户随便拿个指针就可以直接访\n问了！意味着我们也可以不需要使用系统调用来读写shm。我们之前使用动态库也可以没系\n统调用。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "共享区这个不属于内核空间，是属于用户空间的。所以我们用户随便拿个指针就可以直接访问了！意味着我们也可以不需要使用系统调用来读写shm。我们之前使用动态库也可以没系统调用。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Nj4jKHcyVZjZh2IK78Wak",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 29.383341471354186,
      "y": 2288.0777570936407,
      "width": 644.6998901367188,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 915113439,
      "version": 415,
      "versionNonce": 450894225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "总结： 创建和“删除”shm需要系统调用，使用shm不需要(类似malloc())。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "总结： 创建和“删除”shm需要系统调用，使用shm不需要(类似malloc())。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S6rgEJcuGFrWJE4SBTp49",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 21.333353678385436,
      "y": 2338.5776960584844,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b70",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1849658257,
      "version": 436,
      "versionNonce": 61390705,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我们创建管道的时候用了系统调用，使用管道的时候也用了，这也是和共享内存的差别。用\n户空间最有代表的就是用户可以直接访问。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我们创建管道的时候用了系统调用，使用管道的时候也用了，这也是和共享内存的差别。用户空间最有代表的就是用户可以直接访问。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XHNjF2MDVLC5or4Hcvffl",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 25.333328882853266,
      "y": 2283.3777448866094,
      "width": 646.3999881744385,
      "height": 39.20001220703125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b71",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1333342225,
      "version": 305,
      "versionNonce": 2082580817,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773321325325,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x_hjN8SYxaKE3ew8Ax_9f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 632.533671061198,
      "y": 1957.3777296278204,
      "width": 850.4000244140624,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b73",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1963597649,
      "version": 373,
      "versionNonce": 1255155263,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "k41OEZilRy5K3x6qQlHZo",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1773321340684,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果我们不想用这个共享内存了怎么办，我们要先去掉页表的映射关系，这个过程叫做去关联。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果我们不想用这个共享内存了怎么办，我们要先去掉页表的映射关系，这个过程叫做去关联。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0ylByb7okZcy3eBbXIGKF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 904.5334383646648,
      "y": 2068.177717420789,
      "width": 60,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b74",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1631652497,
      "version": 367,
      "versionNonce": 1905684895,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773317609708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "理解：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "理解：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PAVWY9KVRxUWMZpKOzc20",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 939.733378092448,
      "y": 2109.7777235243047,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b75",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1203609873,
      "version": 98,
      "versionNonce": 1831045073,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "AdwH1IICN8HxFDW1Ley5n",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1773320807996,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "共享内存的存在是可以同时存在多份的！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "共享内存的存在是可以同时存在多份的！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
