      "seed": 1993335915,
      "version": 406,
      "versionNonce": 1658053061,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773575419804,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "老的值会和新的值进行比较、校验，OK了就替换",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "老的值会和新的值进行比较、校验，OK了就替换",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A1XlaWXlbjsV4zAeTfgsM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 813.3735453287761,
      "y": 7062.377744886609,
      "width": 788.719970703125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bB1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1001201259,
      "version": 258,
      "versionNonce": 95246053,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773574432927,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "先补充一下之前共享内存代码这块：我们把之前的代码中的大小变成4097进行测试，之前\n我们说过大小必须是4096的整数倍，那会发生什么呢。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "先补充一下之前共享内存代码这块：我们把之前的代码中的大小变成4097进行测试，之前我们说过大小必须是4096的整数倍，那会发生什么呢。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "juy-BHAuGUywOGLB-zTb6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 815.403544108073,
      "y": 7122.077802870008,
      "width": 490.25994873046875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bB2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2013958597,
      "version": 261,
      "versionNonce": 1363989419,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773574436797,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "操作系统会给你申请4096*2，这不就是浪费了4095嘛.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "操作系统会给你申请4096*2，这不就是浪费了4095嘛.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hqyAPP9LxytwmbuLlHOcz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 819.9436747233074,
      "y": 7158.47782728407,
      "width": 783.5799560546875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bB3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1358174475,
      "version": 380,
      "versionNonce": 453016837,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1773574440677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "那这样难道就不可以嘛。当然不行，如果你实际是4097，操作系统给你了4096*2，那我\n们访问越界的时候，可能都不会有提示了。至于为什么会这样给，我们后面线程的时候来\n说。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "那这样难道就不可以嘛。当然不行，如果你实际是4097，操作系统给你了4096*2，那我们访问越界的时候，可能都不会有提示了。至于为什么会这样给，我们后面线程的时候来说。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
